---
import portrait from '../images/responsive/piyush-devfest-320.webp';
---
<aside class="article-career" aria-labelledby="article-career-title" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <img class="article-career__portrait" src={portrait.src} width={portrait.width} height={portrait.height} alt="Piyush Mehta speaking at a developer event" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  <div class="article-career__content">
    <h2 id="article-career-title">I’m Piyush. Let’s build something reliable.</h2>
    <p>Senior software engineer building AI workflows and web platforms. Based in Canada, open to senior engineering and applied AI opportunities with remote teams.</p>
    <nav aria-label="Connect with Piyush">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact-me/">Discuss an opportunity <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6" /></svg></a>
      <div class="article-career__links"><a href="/resume/">Read my résumé</a><a href="/projects/">Explore my work</a><a href="/services/">Consulting services</a></div>
    </nav>
  </div>
</aside>
<style>
  .article-career { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 7rem minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 2rem; padding-block: 2.5rem 3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-card-border); }
  .article-career__portrait { width: 7rem; height: 9rem; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; border-radius: 0; }
  .article-career h2 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.2; color: var(--color-text-primary); text-wrap: balance; }
  .article-career p { margin: 0; max-width: 60ch; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }
  .article-career nav { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .article-career .btn-primary { color: var(--color-accent-foreground); gap: 0.75rem; }
  .article-career svg { width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; }
  .article-career__links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .article-career__links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 2.75rem; color: var(--color-text-primary); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 0.25em; font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .article-career a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .article-career { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; padding-block: 2rem; }
    .article-career__portrait { width: 5rem; height: 6rem; }
    .article-career .btn-primary { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
